/mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Our visualization of this set is shown in the diagram below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-6943c25cd605fefd14e79015d8ccc5b5\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/6943c25cd605fefd14e79015d8ccc5b5\"></div></div></div>",
