    "q-181966": {
      "dom_id": "step-q181966",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Which of the following is a representation of the set $S=Z\\times Z$ in the Cartesian plane?",
      "worked_solution": "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\n$$\nA\\times B=\\{(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in A,\\,b\\in B\\}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the set \n\n$$\nS=Z\\times Z\n$$\n\ncontains every point in ${R}^{2}$ whose $x$-coordinate is an integer number and whose $y$-coordinate is an integer number.\n\n$$\nS=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,x\\in Z,\\,y\\in Z\\}.\n$$\n\nTo visualize $S$, consider ${S}_{-1}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate equals $-1$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any integer number.\n\n$$\n{S}_{-1}=\\{(-1,y)\\,:\\,y\\in Z\\}.\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{-1}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14242415/assets/9673951b4e72ba503e740369462f9e528e43ffc083706ee558ade7ccd52702f5.png)\n\nNext, consider ${S}_{0}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate equals $0$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any integer number.\n\n$$\n{S}_{0}=\\{(0,y)\\,:\\,y\\in Z\\}.\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{0}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14242415/assets/797b66a293eb241f841869abe97e324f4301907f71029acceefd68487bef1b4f.png)\n\nWe can create the subsets $…,{S}_{-3},{S}_{-2},{S}_{1},{S}_{2},{S}_{3},…$ similarly. Our Cartesian product $S$ is the *union* of these subsets:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S & =…\\cup {S}_{-3}\\cup {S}_{-2}\\cup {S}_{-1}\\cup {S}_{0}\\cup {S}_{1}\\cup \\text{ }{S}_{2}\\cup {S}_{3}… \\\\  & ={⋃}_{i\\in Z}{S}_{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can visualize $Z\\times Z$ as the set of points in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14242415/assets/de19fcf0f246b09d4bb957568e026b36de3f55c1a6c7065d79faacee794a8326.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-181966-a",
              "type": "image",
              "value": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14242415/assets/463ae2387423a48dd557af8cfd9b01b6bc08b95f1b3c2f337c6b0c53d3731fa2.png",
              "html": "<img src=\"/graphics/q-181966-a-2\">",
