><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>S</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>…</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">⋃</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we can visualize <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"166\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as the set of points in the diagram below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-d9e9afd35330ee2b23625ce1e0972466\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d9e9afd35330ee2b23625ce1e0972466\"></div></div></div>",
